$DATUM M1. L1H2 (3.58 g, 0.01 mol), diethanolamine (0.9581 ml, 0.01 mol),
dicyclohexylcarbodiimide (DCC) (4.12 g, 0.02 mol) and a catalytic amount
of DMAP are used to prepare M1 as per this procedure. The product was
purified through column chromatography filled with silica gel as the
stationary phase and acetonitrile as the mobile phase. Yield (45%).
Elemental analysis calcd. for C22H21O8N: calc. (found) C, 61.82 (61.02);
H, 4.95 (5.00); N, 3.28 (3.20). ES-MS: calc. for C22H21O8N (M+), 427.13;
found: 427.93. 1H NMR (CDCl3, δ, TMS, 500.13 MHz): 8.204-7.311 (m, ar,
8H), 4.785-3.286 (-CH2,12H), 2.5-1.6 (br, OH). 13C NMR (CDCl3, δ, TMS,
125.75 MHz]: 172.123 (C=O), 168.641 (C=O), 166.69 (C=O), 165.72 (C=O),
137.40, 133.34, 133.29 (quat-C), 132.69, 132.60, 131.99, 131.16, 131.10,
129.64, 128.92, 128.64, 128.50, 127.44, 127.27, 127.18 (=CH), 66.12
(-CH2), 65.76 (-CH2), 64.42 (-CH2), 64.02 (-CH2), 62.16 (-CH2), 60.37
(-CH2), 51.09 (-CH2), 48.76 (-CH2). IR spectra: (ʋ
cm-1):3500-3200(br-OH), 3062, 2952, 1724 (st, C=O), 1622, 1496, 1444,
1428, 1368, 1279, 1135 (C-O), 1076, 1041, 748. M1. CCDC No. 736229. Mol.
formula C22H16NO8, FW 422.36, space group Pbca, orthorhombic, unit cell
a=19.4811(17), b=7.7079(7), c=26.465(2) A ˚ ; α=β=γ=90 °C V=3974.0(6) A3,
Z=8, g (calc.)=1.412 mg/m3. Final R indices [I>2sigma(I)] R1=0.0765,
wR2=0.2022.
